      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart E \u2014 Powerplant",
      "title_at_revision": "Negative acceleration",
      "text": "No hazardous malfunction of an engine, an auxiliary power unit approved for use in flight, or any component or system associated with the powerplant or auxiliary power unit may occur when the aeroplane is operated at the negative accelerations within the flight envelopes prescribed in CS 23.333. This must be shown for the greatest value and duration of the acceleration expected in service.",
